# AGENT.md — src/config/

Environment loading and global request pipeline configuration.

## Rules

- This is the **only** place allowed to read `process.env` directly.
  Everywhere else injects `ConfigService`.
- Provide a sensible default for every non-secret value so the app boots
  on a fresh clone.
- Never commit real secrets. `.env` is gitignored; `.env.example` documents
  the shape and is committed.
{{#if useZod}}
- `zod.pipe.ts` exposes `ZodValidationPipe`. Apply it per-route with
  `@UsePipes(new ZodValidationPipe(schema))`.
{{/if}}
{{#if useClassValidator}}
- `validation.pipe.ts` exposes the global pipe wired up in `main.ts`.
  It rejects unknown properties, so every accepted field needs a decorator.
{{/if}}
